PAINT - drag the mouse to draw; keyboard + mouse from inside a seed.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (PAINT)
  - an interactive input loop in a seed: getkey / inkey plus mouse x, y, buttons
  - direct pixel drawing

Try it
  PAINT                        REM drag the left button; Q or ESC quits

Build it on the machine
  grow paint          # -> build/PAINT.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as PAINT.SED, ready to use.

